# Blackbox farm accounts file — pick ONE mode.
#
# Mode 1 — register (signup new accounts via temp-mail OTP):
#   Format: register:COUNT:domain
#   COUNT  = number of accounts to create
#   domain = reserved (mailbox domain comes from the CF temp-mail worker)
# register:1:example.com
#
# Mode 2 — google-sso (login existing GSuite/Google accounts, no OTP):
#   One 'email|password' per line. 'email:password' also accepted.
# user@yourworkspace.com|S3cretPassw0rd
# other@yourworkspace.com|OtherPass123
